I did some trial and error lately and I thought that this is kinda helpful
in determining what sort of character to play:
This lists what character class gets what intrinsiscs when.

   | Original            |     7    |   10      |   15   |    20        |
---+---------------------+----------+-----------+--------+--------------+
A  |fast, stealthy       |          |auto search|        |              |
B  |poison resistant     | fast     |           |stealth |              |
C  | ----                | fast     |           |warned  |              |
E  |auto search, see invisible, stealthy, sleep resistant, fast         |
H  |poison resistant     |          |           |warned  |              |
K  | ----                | fast     |           |        |              |
P  | ----                | warned   |           |        |fire resistant|
R  |stealth              |          |auto search|        |              | 
S  |fast                 |          |           |stealth |              |
T  | ----                |          |auto search|       /|poison resist |
V  |stealthy, cold resist| fast     |           |      /17\_____________|
W  | ----                |          |           |warned|teleport control|
